  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till LGBTQI+ gemenskapen (CEL)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to LGBTIQ+ community (CEL) - Support to LGBTIQ+ Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r projektet som ambassaden avser st&#xf6;dja &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra skyddet av r&#xe4;ttigheter och v&#xe4;lbefinnande f&#xf6;r HBTQI+-gemenskapen i hela Kosovo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the protection of rights and well being of the LGBTQI+ community across Kosovo</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this contribution is: To improve the protection of rights and wellbeing of the LGBTIQ community across Kosovo. Moreover, this contribution will be contributing towards the following specific objectives:

With the support from the Embassy of Sweden, Center for Equality and Liberty in Kosovo will strengthen the institutional capacities, therefore. This will allow the members of the organization and the community to serve its constituencies better and in long term.

Secondly, with this support the Center will provide direct support to members of LGBTIQ persons. The support that the CEL staff offers is very diverse and covers areas of legal support, psychological and professional / academic support. This holistic approach offers a platform for LGBTIQ members to be fully integrated into Kosovo society.

Third specific objective is to work with a wider society, with the aim of raising the awareness of society on principal rights of LGBTIQ community in Kosovo, thus improving societal and institutional protection of LGBTIQ community in Kosovo.

Additionally, it will advocate with key stakeholders in Kosovo in regard to immediate needs of LGBTIQ persons, therefore ensuring policies and budgeting in Kosovo and in the region reflect the needs of this community.</narrative>
  </description>
